# 2. Partially Working

## 2.1 Title and Commit Message Checks

Title and commit message checks are working in some scenarios, but the behavior is inconsistent.

* The checks do not always execute correctly when the PR is initially created.
* When the title or commit message is subsequently changed, the checks start working.
* Therefore, this functionality requires further investigation and fixing.

